{"id":"c207d0b8-8aa9-5290-95a5-2a6c4484456c","title":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","icon":"⌨️","cover":"none","parentId":"c68ed360-d4f3-50ae-9c0b-3592b669b21b","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:05.786Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T18:35:06.207Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"可搜索的完整清单","title":"每条命令、每个工具","lead":"Agent 处理页面用 MCP 工具；脚本、服务启动、诊断和管理用 CLI。两者调用同一套服务，读写同一个内容库。","facts":[{"label":"CLI 命令","value":"83 条"},{"label":"MCP 工具","value":"47 个"},{"label":"输出","value":"{ ok, data }"},{"label":"冲突退出码","value":"3"}],"art":"agent"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-d1b7742e"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-d2b775c1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"怎样调用 CLI"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CLI 是一个 Node.js 脚本，每次执行一条命令后退出，不需要常驻服务或打开的窗口。下文的 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 代表实际的命令前缀，并没有全局安装的 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 命令。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cfb77108"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-d0b7729b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 独立运行包（需要 Node.js 22.12+）\nnode /绝对路径/runtime/scripts/cli.mjs projects list --json\n\n# macOS 桌面 App 自带的运行时（无需另装 Node）\nELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 \"/Applications/ShowAI.app/Contents/MacOS/ShowAI\" \\\n  \"/Applications/ShowAI.app/Contents/Resources/runtime/scripts/cli.mjs\" projects list --json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"桌面 App 的 "},{"type":"text","text":"设置 → Agent → 本地连接","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 会给出本机可执行文件、CLI 路径和环境变量，直接复制即可。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d5b77a7a"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"通用选项"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-37a978a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9d3fe325"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作用"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8941f415"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9c3fe192"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b6ae6982"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--home PATH","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6a74d2cd"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1817ea5a"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"使用指定内容库；也可以用环境变量 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_HOME","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。默认 "},{"type":"text","text":"~/.showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-44ae0d62"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1917ebed"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b7ae6b15"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--project ID","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-476fc724"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-47411ebb"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"指定项目。省略时按当前目录所在的 Git 根目录解析"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4c98896f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-46411d28"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b4ae665c"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--source-directory DIR","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-86d321e7"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-217a5950"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用这个目录而不是当前目录来解析项目"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-610c5c7c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-227a5ae3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b5ae67ef"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8c7f8efe"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f0f2a871"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"输出机器可读的 JSON"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-11f739a9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eff2a6de"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b2ae6336"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--help","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-61b389e1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cc691786"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不带命令时显示总览；带命令时返回该命令对应的指南"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bc8b5eb6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cd691919"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b3ae64c9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d6b77c0d"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"加 "},{"type":"text","text":"--json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 时，成功返回 "},{"type":"text","text":"{\"ok\": true, \"data\": …}","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；失败返回 "},{"type":"text","text":"{\"ok\": false, \"error\": {\"code\", \"message\"}}","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 并以非零码退出，页面冲突（"},{"type":"text","text":"CONFLICT","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"）的退出码是 "},{"type":"text","text":"3","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，其他错误是 1。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d3b77754"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-d4b778e7"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"CLI 命令"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"搜索命令、说明或参数，或按分组筛选。展开一条命令查看参数和示例。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c9b76796"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-commands","version":"1.0.0","props":{"groups":[{"id":"start","label":"启动与连接"},{"id":"project","label":"项目与指南"},{"id":"pages","label":"页面读写"},{"id":"deliver","label":"导出与独立呈现"},{"id":"catalog","label":"组件与目录"},{"id":"template","label":"模板"},{"id":"publish","label":"发布"},{"id":"library","label":"内容库与搜索"},{"id":"recovery","label":"冲突与恢复"},{"id":"sync","label":"同步"}],"commands":[{"group":"start","command":"serve [--port PORT] [--no-open]","summary":"启动本地浏览器工作台","detail":"只监听 127.0.0.1；默认使用一个空闲端口并打开浏览器。与桌面 App 读写同一个内容库。","flags":[{"flag":"--port PORT","meaning":"指定端口"},{"flag":"--no-open","meaning":"不自动打开浏览器"},{"flag":"--home PATH","meaning":"使用指定内容库"}],"example":"showai serve --port 5173"},{"group":"start","command":"mcp","summary":"以内容库模式启动 stdio MCP","detail":"不绑定项目：工具调用都要显式传 projectId；可用 projects_list、project_resolve、project_create 选择项目。ShowAI 插件默认使用这种模式。","flags":[{"flag":"--presentation-directory PATH","meaning":"page_present 写出预览文件的位置"}],"example":"showai mcp --home ~/.showai"},{"group":"start","command":"mcp --project PROJECT","summary":"以项目模式启动 stdio MCP","detail":"连接固定到一个已存在的项目；传入其他 projectId 会被拒绝。","flags":[{"flag":"--templates ID[@VERSION],ID","meaning":"为本连接预选任务模板（只能和 --project 一起用）"},{"flag":"--presentation-directory PATH","meaning":"page_present 写出预览文件的位置"}],"example":"claude mcp add --transport stdio --scope local showai-P -- node /abs/cli.mjs mcp --project P"},{"group":"start","command":"mcp --public","summary":"启动只含公开资源的 MCP","detail":"不读取任何项目数据，只提供公开目录、guide 和 render_document。不接受 --project 或 --templates。"},{"group":"start","command":"mcp serve --state DIR --public-url HTTPS_ORIGIN","summary":"启动 HTTP MCP 服务","detail":"供远程客户端通过 HTTPS 连接，协议为 showai-agent-http-v1。任务模板由客户端用 template_context 选择，不接受 --templates。","flags":[{"flag":"--state DIR","meaning":"服务状态目录，默认在内容库的 local/agent-server"},{"flag":"--public-url ORIGIN","meaning":"对外的 HTTPS 地址"},{"flag":"--sync-server ORIGIN","meaning":"允许访问私有项目的同步服务器，逗号分隔"},{"flag":"--port PORT","meaning":"监听端口"}]},{"group":"start","command":"runtime info","summary":"查看运行时版本与能力","detail":"返回版本、能力协议、容量和阅读器编译方式（readerCompilation）。插件启动器用它检查运行时是否兼容。","example":"showai runtime info --json"},{"group":"start","command":"runtime register","summary":"把当前运行时登记到内容库","detail":"写入内容库的 agent-runtime.json，插件据此找到 CLI。桌面 App 启动时会自动登记；独立运行包需要手动执行一次。","example":"showai runtime register --json"},{"group":"project","command":"projects current","summary":"解析当前目录对应的项目","detail":"按 --project → --source-directory → 当前目录所在 Git 根目录的顺序确定项目，不存在时创建。同一目录的多个会话共用一个项目。","flags":[{"flag":"--source-directory DIR","meaning":"宿主项目的绝对路径"},{"flag":"--project ID","meaning":"显式指定项目，优先级最高"}],"example":"showai projects current --source-directory /abs/my-repo --json"},{"group":"project","command":"projects list","summary":"列出内容库中的项目","example":"showai projects list --json"},{"group":"project","command":"projects create --name NAME","summary":"新建一个独立命名的项目","detail":"普通工作用 projects current 按目录解析；只有需要单独项目时才新建。","flags":[{"flag":"--harness HOST --session ID","meaning":"记录创建它的 Agent 会话（元数据）"}]},{"group":"project","command":"projects bind PROJECT --harness HOST --session ID","summary":"记录项目与 Agent 会话的绑定","detail":"绑定只作为元数据保存，不决定默认写入位置。"},{"group":"project","command":"guide [TOPIC]","summary":"读取一个主题的操作指南","detail":"不带主题时列出全部主题。主题见下方表格；`guide presentation --stage STAGE` 读取系统呈现基线的某个阶段。","example":"showai guide authoring --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages list","summary":"列出项目中的页面","detail":"返回标题、ID 和当前 hash。","example":"showai pages list --project P --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages create","summary":"新建页面","detail":"默认创建 Page；可从页面 JSON 创建，文件中的组件包会导入项目。","flags":[{"flag":"--title TITLE","meaning":"页面标题"},{"flag":"--kind page|board","meaning":"根容器类型"},{"flag":"--input FILE","meaning":"从 .showai.json 创建"}],"example":"showai pages create --project P --input page.showai.json --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages read PAGE","summary":"以结构化数据读取页面","detail":"默认返回 JSON 与 hash、revision。读取会保留一份基线，供以后 diff。","flags":[{"flag":"--format json|markdown","meaning":"Markdown 便于阅读文字和组件数据"},{"flag":"--detail full|outline","meaning":"outline 只列出结构与稳定 ID"},{"flag":"--blocks ID,ID","meaning":"只读选定区块（局部投影，不能用来保存整页）"},{"flag":"--rendered false","meaning":"只返回原始源码，不在浏览器中计算组件的派生值"}],"example":"showai pages read PAGE --project P --detail outline --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages read PAGE --view image","summary":"把页面渲染成 PNG","detail":"在隔离的浏览器中渲染已保存的页面。需要本机有 Chrome、Edge 或 Chromium，或设置 SHOWAI_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE。","flags":[{"flag":"--width / --height","meaning":"视口尺寸，默认 1000 × 900"},{"flag":"--theme light|dark","meaning":"主题"},{"flag":"--out FILE","meaning":"输出路径"},{"flag":"--base-hash HASH","meaning":"页面已变化时拒绝截图"}],"example":"showai pages read PAGE --project P --view image --theme dark --width 1000 --out shot.png --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages read PAGE --view html","summary":"生成可交互的 HTML 并检查 DOM","detail":"返回无障碍树和交互后的状态。--state 文件可包含视口、主题和一串动作（hover、click、fill、select、check、uncheck、drag）。","flags":[{"flag":"--state FILE","meaning":"读取选项与动作序列"},{"flag":"--draft","meaning":"只在预览中启用组件编辑，不写回页面"},{"flag":"--presentation reading|spatial","meaning":"呈现方式"}],"example":"showai pages read PAGE --project P --view html --state reading-state.json --out preview.html --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages apply PAGE --input OPS","summary":"按区块 ID 应用一组修改","detail":"操作包括 page.set、block.insert / remove / replace / move、block.text.set、block.attrs.set、component.insert、surface.create / wrap / layout.set 等。","flags":[{"flag":"--input FILE","meaning":"操作数组，或 {operations: [...]}"},{"flag":"--base-hash HASH","meaning":"读取时得到的内容 hash；内容已变化则返回 CONFLICT"},{"flag":"--base-revision REV","meaning":"读取时得到的资源 revision；版本化内容库需要"},{"flag":"--message / --group / --operation-id","meaning":"说明这次修改、归入编辑组；重试同一请求时复用 operation-id"}],"example":"showai pages apply PAGE --project P --input ops.json --base-hash H --base-revision R --json"},{"group":"pages","command":"pages save PAGE --input FILE","summary":"用完整页面替换当前内容","detail":"必须基于最新的完整读取结果；局部投影不能用来保存。","flags":[{"flag":"--input FILE","meaning":"完整的 .showai.json"},{"flag":"--base-hash HASH","meaning":"读取时得到的内容 hash；内容已变化则返回 CONFLICT"},{"flag":"--base-revision REV","meaning":"读取时得到的资源 revision；版本化内容库需要"},{"flag":"--message / --group / --operation-id","meaning":"说明这次修改、归入编辑组；重试同一请求时复用 operation-id"}]},{"group":"pages","command":"pages diff PAGE --since HASH","summary":"列出自上次读取以来的变化","detail":"按区块 ID 返回新增、删除、移动和字段变化，包括用户在工作台中的修改。找不到基线时返回 MISSING_BASELINE。"},{"group":"pages","command":"boards read PAGE","summary":"以图像方式读取 Board","detail":"小画板返回一张完整图；大画板返回总览和相互重叠的图块，以及元素索引。后续查询用返回的 snapshotId 固定在同一次截取上。","flags":[{"flag":"--board NODE","meaning":"根是 Page 时指定要读的 Board"},{"flag":"--mode visual|tile|region|element|source","meaning":"读取方式"},{"flag":"--snapshot ID","meaning":"沿用之前的截取"},{"flag":"--tiles T1,T2","meaning":"读取指定图块（最多 8 个）"},{"flag":"--node ID","meaning":"指定元素"},{"flag":"--scale N","meaning":"缩放 0.1–4"},{"flag":"--state FILE","meaning":"更多选项的 JSON 文件"}]},{"group":"deliver","command":"export --format html","summary":"导出单文件 HTML","detail":"默认把阅读器、内容和组件运行代码都打包进去，可直接离线打开。","flags":[{"flag":"--page PAGE","meaning":"要导出的页面"},{"flag":"--components bundled|remote","meaning":"remote 需要已验证的发布地址，阅读时要联网"},{"flag":"--presentation spatial|reading","meaning":"呈现方式"},{"flag":"--out FILE","meaning":"输出路径"},{"flag":"--overwrite","meaning":"允许覆盖已存在的文件"}],"example":"showai export --project P --page PAGE --format html --out ./report.html --json"},{"group":"deliver","command":"export --format inline","summary":"导出会话内显示的 HTML 片段","detail":"供支持 HTML 显示的 Agent 宿主使用。组件必须是 bundled；最终压缩后的片段不能超过 1,000,000 字节，超出时导出选定区块并附上完整 HTML。","example":"showai export --project P --page PAGE --format inline --out ./report-inline.html --json"},{"group":"deliver","command":"export --format site","summary":"把整个项目导出为静态网站","detail":"归档的页面不会导出。网站使用共享的阅读器资源，需要通过 HTTP 访问或部署到静态托管。","example":"showai export --project P --format site --out ./site --json"},{"group":"deliver","command":"export --blocks ID,ID","summary":"只导出选定的区块或容器","detail":"ID 是页面节点的 attrs.id（用 pages read --detail outline 查看）。选中的容器包含整个子树；局部导出默认使用阅读排版并隐藏页面标题。","example":"showai export --project P --page PAGE --blocks CHART_ID,METRICS_ID --format html --out ./selected.html --json"},{"group":"deliver","command":"render --input FILE --out PAGE.html","summary":"不经过项目，直接渲染一份页面 JSON","detail":"独立呈现：不保存到任何个人项目。正式工作应先保存页面再导出。","flags":[{"flag":"--overwrite","meaning":"允许覆盖"}]},{"group":"deliver","command":"render --template ID --title TITLE --out PAGE.html","summary":"用公开模板渲染一个独立页面"},{"group":"deliver","command":"public list","summary":"列出公开组件与模板","detail":"无需登录或项目。","flags":[{"flag":"--kind component|template","meaning":"类型"},{"flag":"--query TEXT","meaning":"按名称、说明筛选"}]},{"group":"deliver","command":"public describe ID","summary":"读取公开组件或模板的说明","flags":[{"flag":"--view guide|schema|examples|source","meaning":"需要的视图"},{"flag":"--kind component|template","meaning":"类型"}]},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog list","summary":"列出可用的组件或模板","detail":"默认返回全部内置组件加当前项目的组件，包含名称、说明、场景和用于查询详情的身份。不含 schema 和源码。","flags":[{"flag":"--kind component|template","meaning":"类型"},{"flag":"--scope builtin|global|published|project|all","meaning":"作用域"},{"flag":"--query TEXT","meaning":"筛选"},{"flag":"--limit N --cursor C","meaning":"分页，N 为 1–50"}],"example":"showai catalog list --kind component --project P --json"},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog describe ID --view VIEW","summary":"读取组件或模板的一个视图","detail":"视图：summary（默认）、guide、development、parameters、schema、examples、dependencies、source、full。full 不含源码和运行代码。","flags":[{"flag":"--scope / --version / --integrity","meaning":"精确定位同名的不同版本"},{"flag":"--file PATH","meaning":"source 视图中读取指定文件；'*' 为完整包"},{"flag":"--out FILE","meaning":"保存到文件，只返回路径"}],"example":"showai catalog describe chart --view schema --project P --json"},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog describe ID --view parameters","summary":"按字段分页读取参数说明","detail":"把 schema、字段含义和真实样例合在一起。","flags":[{"flag":"--parameter-path PATH","meaning":"只读某个字段或子树，如 slides[].regions[].box"},{"flag":"--parameter-offset N / --parameter-limit N","meaning":"分页，默认 20、最多 50"},{"flag":"--known-hash HASH","meaning":"跳过已持有的相同内容"}]},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog import --input DIR","summary":"导入并编译一个组件包","detail":"保存为项目中的新版本；同一版本已存在时不会覆盖。","example":"showai catalog import --project P --input ./value-slider --json"},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog save --input FILE","summary":"保存一份组件源码为新版本","detail":"输入是 source 视图导出的 JSON（manifest、schema、源码文件和资源），修改后换新版本号保存。"},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog fork --input REF --version V","summary":"把一个精确版本派生到当前项目","detail":"记录来源 parents。需要可读取的源码。","flags":[{"flag":"--id ID","meaning":"新的逻辑名称"},{"flag":"--name NAME","meaning":"显示名称"}]},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog promote --input REF --to global","summary":"把项目版本注册到本机全局目录","detail":"复制完整依赖闭包，不上传任何内容。必须显式写 --to global；项目绑定的 MCP 不能执行这一步。"},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog merge preview --input FILE","summary":"预览三方合并（不写入）","detail":"输入包含 base、ours、theirs 三个精确引用。默认只返回冲突摘要。","flags":[{"flag":"--out FILE","meaning":"保存完整的可编辑合并候选"},{"flag":"--view source","meaning":"直接返回候选内容"}]},{"group":"catalog","command":"catalog merge resolve --input FILE","summary":"以新版本保存合并结果","detail":"输入需包含审阅后的 resolved 包和新 version；记录 parents 与 mergeBase。"},{"group":"template","command":"template import DIR","summary":"导入模板文件夹","detail":"校验 README 头信息与指南，编译模板自带的组件。","example":"showai template import ./my-template --project P --json"},{"group":"template","command":"template export ID --out NEW_DIR","summary":"把模板导出为文件夹","flags":[{"flag":"--scope / --version / --integrity","meaning":"指定精确版本"}]},{"group":"template","command":"template context","summary":"读取系统基线与所选模板的 README","detail":"返回精确引用和分页的组件索引。","flags":[{"flag":"--templates ID[@VERSION],ID","meaning":"要使用的模板"}]},{"group":"template","command":"template guide STAGE","summary":"读取某一阶段的指南","detail":"阶段：intent、evidence、understanding、design、authoring、review。返回系统指南加所选模板的同阶段指南。","flags":[{"flag":"--templates ID","meaning":"所选模板"},{"flag":"--input CONTEXT.json","meaning":"沿用 template context 的结果"},{"flag":"--file NAME --id TEMPLATE","meaning":"读取指南文件夹中的某个子文件"}],"example":"showai template guide design --project P --templates my-template --json"},{"group":"template","command":"template apply ID","summary":"用模板创建页面，或插入现有页面","detail":"单独使用时新建资源并保持模板的容器类型；加 --page 时把模板根节点作为模块插入，所有 ID 与视图引用一起