","summary":"重建搜索索引"},{"group":"library","command":"library policy","summary":"查看或设置自动维护","flags":[{"flag":"--automatic true|false","meaning":"开启或关闭自动维护"}]},{"group":"library","command":"library archive --out NEW_DIR","summary":"导出完整备份","detail":"--out 必须是新的绝对路径。"},{"group":"library","command":"library verify-archive DIR","summary":"校验一份备份"},{"group":"library","command":"library init","summary":"初始化版本化内容库","detail":"新的空内容库会自动初始化，通常不需要手动执行。"},{"group":"library","command":"library import --source OLD_PATH","summary":"准备把旧内容库导入为新格式","detail":"生成导入报告并校验，不立即启用；原始文件保留。","flags":[{"flag":"--home NEW_OR_SAME","meaning":"目标内容库"}]},{"group":"library","command":"library imports","summary":"列出已准备的导入"},{"group":"library","command":"library activate IMPORT_ID","summary":"启用一次已校验的导入"},{"group":"library","command":"library migrate","summary":"原地准备、校验并启用新格式","detail":"等于对当前内容库执行 import 再 activate，保留原始数据。"},{"group":"recovery","command":"workspace conflicts","summary":"列出外部修改造成的冲突","detail":"例如其他程序直接改了工作区文件。"},{"group":"recovery","command":"workspace conflict ID","summary":"查看一个冲突保留的外部内容与基线"},{"group":"recovery","command":"workspace resolve ID --resolution R","summary":"处理外部修改","detail":"R 为 discard（丢弃外部修改）、import（校验后导入）或 merge（审阅后合并，配合 --input）。保留的外部快照仍可查看。"},{"group":"recovery","command":"workspace recover-package ID","summary":"把被外部修改的组件包恢复为可编辑草稿","detail":"同时恢复原版本的不可变内容；修好草稿后以新版本发布。"},{"group":"recovery","command":"workspace merge PAGE --input DRAFT --base-revision BASE","summary":"比较草稿、基线与当前页面","detail":"不带 --revision 时只预览；加 --revision CURRENT 保存审阅后的结果。"},{"group":"sync","command":"sync status","summary":"查看所有连接与项目的同步状态"},{"group":"sync","command":"sync connect --url SERVER --account NAME","summary":"连接一个项目服务器","detail":"凭据从文件或环境变量读取（SHOWAI_SERVER_PASSWORD、SHOWAI_SERVER_TOKEN、SHOWAI_REGISTRATION_KEY），输出中不含令牌。","flags":[{"flag":"--password-file / --token-file FILE","meaning":"密码或令牌文件"},{"flag":"--registration-key-file FILE --view register","meaning":"注册新账号"},{"flag":"--invite URL